My","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13228932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom","html_url":"https://github.com/MajorMcDoom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-01T03:31:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T03:31:28Z","body":"Hey there, just leaving a little note:\n\nI think it's possible to interpret this as a bug/glitch, strictly on the basis that there are discontinuity artifacts during continuous motion.\n\nThat said, some things (even behaviour) are intentionally different between the native version and the add-on. There are gonna be some trade-offs and maybe some things just have to be approached differently. While I cannot speak to the specific decisions and deviations like @QbieShay can, as a rule of thumb, parity between the two versions is not guaranteed. They'll probably diverge even more from here on.\n\nNothing wrong with this report! Just reminding readers going forward to come at these strictly from the perspective of the native version. e.g. \"this behaviour is jarring\" or \"how to achieve this result\", instead of how it is different from the original add-on.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5488484158/reactio